WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Welcome. Let's spend two hundred dollars where your customers already are.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Your Google Business Profile is free.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Flyers for three nearby streets cost about eighty dollars.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
A boosted local post, seventy.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
And thank-you cards for your best customers, fifty.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Ask every new customer how they found you.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Keep a simple tally for thirty days.
